.SH DESCRIPTION
Adds a breakpoint to the debugger for the current session.
The function sends an \f[CR]add_breakpoint\f[R] request on
\f[CR]CHAN_DEBUG\f[R] (channel 4) and returns the server\-assigned
breakpoint ID.
.PP
The debugger must be enabled via \f[CR]bc_debug_enable()\f[R] before
adding breakpoints.
.PP
